  m_text: 'ItComesSinWaves

    A Nom Kabar Adventure

    Created By Tom Harding

    Music
    and SFX by Dakoda Mondragon.

    https://www.dakodacomposer.com/


    You are
    a ship... you are sailing to the center...

    Trouble comes... it is your test...

    So
    the Gong Sounds... will you save the souls or even save your self?

    Whilst
    you navigate the inevitable challenges.

    Conquer the waves. Fish for Souls...
    Rescue them...

    They need you.


    Created in Unity for GameOff 2025'
